  "body": "Found while fixing #1431. In the browser (wasm) build, Save, Save As and Post now download through `crates/ui/src/browser_files.rs` (`offer`), but four exports are still refused by name and greyed with \"this export does not download yet (#1431)\":\n\n- Setup sheet export (`SetupSheetDialog`)\n- Tool list export (`ToolListExportDialog`)\n- Stock STL export (`ExportStockDialog`)\n- Tool library export (`export_tool_library_dialog`)\n\nEach already builds its bytes before writing them; the work is the same split #1431 made for Save and Post (an app-layer function that returns the bytes, the desktop path writing them) and a `browser_build` arm that hands them to `browser_files::offer`, then removing the row from `browser_files::refusal` / the `NO_EXPORT` buttons.\n\nDone means: in the browser build each of the four exports downloads the same bytes the desktop writes (pinned per export by a test comparing the two), and `NO_EXPORT` has no remaining users.\n",
